## 2. Proposed Architecture: The Hybrid Intelligent Assistant

To make the bot truly "smart" without losing its lightweight CPU efficiency, we transition from a **fragile single-model generative bot** to a **Robust Hybrid Intelligent Architecture**:

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    UserInput([User Query in CLI]) --> Preprocessor[Text Normalizer & Spell/Typo Handling]
    Preprocessor --> IntentClassifier{Intent & OOD Classifier}

    %% Intent routing
    IntentClassifier -->|1. Casual Banter / Greeting| ChitChat[Chit-Chat Handler: Polite greetings & persona]
    IntentClassifier -->|2. Out-of-Scope Query| FallbackEngine[Intelligent Fallback & Graceful Referral]
    IntentClassifier -->|3. Ambiguous / Partial Query| Clarifier[Smart Disambiguation & Suggested Prompts]
    IntentClassifier -->|4. Admissions In-Domain Query| SemanticRetriever[Semantic Matcher / Dense BM25 Retriever]

    %% Admissions pipeline
    SemanticRetriever --> ConfidenceCheck{Match Confidence Score}
    ConfidenceCheck -->|Low Confidence < 0.45| Clarifier
    ConfidenceCheck -->|High Confidence >= 0.45| ContextBuilder[Assemble Grounded Prompt + KB Context]
    ContextBuilder --> NeuralLM[TinyGPT Neural Generator with Constrained Decoding]
    NeuralLM --> OutputPostProcess[Response Sanitizer & Post-Processor]

    %% Final outputs
    ChitChat --> FinalResponse([Final Output to User])
    FallbackEngine --> FinalResponse
    Clarifier --> FinalResponse
    OutputPostProcess --> FinalResponse
```

